Version 1.0

PlantGuardAI is an AI-powered mobile application developed to detect plant diseases from leaf images using Artificial Intelligence. The application helps farmers, students, researchers, and gardening enthusiasts identify plant diseases quickly and accurately.

Key Features:
AI Plant Disease Detection
Multi-Language Support
Plant Scan History
Smart Plant Monitoring
Easy-to-Use Interface

